stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending: add-task
    pending --> ready: dependencias resueltas
    ready --> in_progress: start (sin pausa, sin árbol sucio, intentos < 3)
    in_progress --> review: compuerta local aprobada
    review --> verified: QA + revisión senior (otros agentes)
    verified --> merged: CI verde registrado
    review --> in_progress: changes_requested / retry
    in_progress --> failed: fallo de implementación
    in_progress --> blocked: bloqueo
    review --> blocked: bloqueo
    review --> failed: revisión rechazada sin intentos
    failed --> ready: retry (intentos < 3)
    blocked --> ready: unblock explícito
    pending --> cancelled: decisión humana
    ready --> cancelled: decisión humana
    in_progress --> cancelled: decisión humana
    review --> cancelled: decisión humana
    verified --> cancelled: decisión humana
    blocked --> cancelled: decisión humana
    failed --> cancelled: decisión humana
    merged --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]

    note right of in_progress
        in_progress → merged NO existe.
        El núcleo lanza TransitionError.
    end note

    note right of verified
        Exige stage = ci_green.
        QA y senior no pueden ser
        el implementador.
    end note
